-custom-fancy-schmancy-character-sheet-thoughts?p=1470430#post1470430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What are the changes from Hero to Demigod level? I'm still a little new, and I don't think I've gotten that far yet.<br /> <br /> (ETA: The blacked-out section on the Combat page is intended for the new Origin --&gt; Hero stuff--Legend Score, Boons, etc. For my own group, I was going to keep that blacked out for simplicity's sake until after they gain a Legend.)</div> </div> </div> </div>More Legend dots, which means more titles, knacks and boons.<br /> <br /> There are some new rules like mastery of a domain and damaging the area but I haven't gotten my head around those yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11830-joboo","name":"Joboo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}